    "notes": "The first exact catalog target for this connector (#300). Steam pin of the public branch head observed 2026-09-25: tool app 4019830, Linux depot 3501791, build 25465077. Superseded as the default by linux-25501739; kept so a server still on this build gets a matching plugin. The plugin now holds the Takaro connection itself; its four static native libraries are pinned by source archive hash in `build.deps`, built on the same Bookworm glibc as the dedicated server image. `verification.required` is `contract` until this pin is proven at runtime: the plugin's unit and native connector suites run on every build, but a real boot needs a Dragonwilds Linux dedicated server (~5.4 GB Steam depot) that a hosted runner does not install, so runtime levels are separate rather than claimed here."
  },
